[en.IDEA_C15_SACRAMENT]
The Crystal Sacrament

[en.IDEA_C15_SACRAMENT_desc]
Under the guidance of the Crystal Sacrament, the ponies of the Crystal Empire are civilized, polite, loyal to the Empire, and supportive of the royal family.

[zh.IDEA_C15_SACRAMENT]
《水晶圣章》

[zh.IDEA_C15_SACRAMENT_desc]
在《水晶圣章》的指引下，水晶帝国的小马们谈吐文明，举止文雅，热爱帝国，拥护皇室。
